# The pistol's butt, struck at a target eight tenths of a unit away that stands
# still, twice (the first-person animation is 45 frames, less a quarter, and the
# blow lands four frames in, less a quarter): a blow dealt by a player who is
# standing is at the damage's scale of 0, which is its minimum of 40; the shield
# takes it, then the body. The target is left alive: the weapon of a body is
# picked up by whoever stands over it, which the simulation does not do.
scenario melee_standing
map bloodgulch
start flat_field 77.9 -166.2 0.32 0.0
target 78.8 -166.2 0.32 3.14159265
weapon weapons/pistol/pistol
ticks 200
# aim at the body
input 0 200 pitch=-0.2
input 60 61 melee=1
input 110 111 melee=1

tolerance position 0
tolerance velocity 0
tolerance facing 0
tolerance state 0
tolerance rounds 0
tolerance heat 0
tolerance shield 0
tolerance body 0
tolerance stun 0
tolerance life 0
tolerance hit 0
tolerance shots 0
tolerance age 0
